a drone 8 from a turret, with health 100: it flies 2 closer a frame,
and the turret hits it for 40 a frame once it's within 4
    drone     8 from the turret, health 100, alive
add move, shoot and die
    schedule  move shoot die
insert damage before die: die reads the health that damage writes
    schedule  move shoot damage die
frame 1
    ran       move shoot damage die
    drone     6 from the turret, health 100, alive
frame 2
    ran       move shoot damage die
    drone     4 from the turret, health 60, alive
switch shoot off: the turret is reloading
    schedule  move (shoot off) damage die
frame 3
    ran       move damage die
    drone     2 from the turret, health 60, alive
switch shoot back on
    schedule  move shoot damage die
frame 4
    ran       move shoot damage die
    drone     0 from the turret, health 20, alive
frame 5
    ran       move shoot damage die
    drone     0 from the turret, health -20, dead
frame 6
    ran       move shoot damage die
    drone     0 from the turret, health -20, dead
remove shoot: the turret is gone
    schedule  move damage die
